<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-JANSHER BEATS EYLES IN GEZIRA OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-JANSHER BEATS EYLES IN GEZIRA OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the Gezira</p>
<p>Open squash championship on Friday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat 2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) 15-13</p>
<p>15-14 15-6</p>
</text>
